nii é nɔ ga kpeinɲaɠagi,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"nuɓusɛi ɓalaagi, é nɔ ga kpeinɲaɠa koi?»","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/tod_pbt/JOB/25.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/tod_pbt/JOB/26.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/tod_pbt/JOB/24.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":6}